# Authors

open-rknpu contributors.

This project has no single author. It is the work of many contributors, and the
authoritative list is the Git history of this repository
(`git shortlog -sne --all`).

The single entry below is a placeholder for the maintainer of the first public
release (0.1.0). Replace it with a real name and address before publishing, or
delete it if the release should carry no named maintainer.

    <your-name> <you@example.com>
